+ *
+ * You should have received a copy of the GNU Lesser General Public
+ * License along with this library; if not, write to the Free Software
+ * Foundation, Inc., 51 Franklin St, Fifth Floor, Boston, MA 02110-1301, USA
+ *
+ * A sync root registered here is kept where cldapi.dll (the Cloud Files API) keeps the ones it
+ * registers, HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\SyncRootManager\<Id>: its
+ * Path, ProviderName, ProviderVersion, ProviderId, SyncRootIdentity (the Context) and Policies (a
+ * CF_SYNC_POLICIES) as cldapi reads them, so a provider that registers through this class connects
+ * with CfConnectSyncRoot; and the rest of the information (Id, resources, policies as given,
+ * property definitions) for reading it back.
